## Generated schema files. Exception: graph.schema.json is a committed copy of
## drawsem-web/schema/graph.schema.json (synced by `make`) so installed packages
## have it; the pre-commit hook and test-schema-sync.R fail if the two differ.
inst/extdata/*.json
!inst/extdata/graph.schema.json

## Note: DO NOT ignore inst/htmlwidgets/lib/app/ (widget assets needed for install_github)

